| AP, KSP | class without a non-private no-argument constructor | proxy does not compile |
| AP | class with a final method | `IllegalArgumentException` from `MethodSpec.overriding`, the processor crashes |
| AP | class with a static method | the same `IllegalArgumentException`, although the class can be proxied |
| AP | interface inheriting abstract methods (incl. generic, diamond) | `$..._PromisedProxy is not abstract and does not override abstract method get() in ...` |
| AP | class inheriting methods of a base class | the proxy does not override them: the call runs on the proxy, not on the component |
| AP | class inheriting a final method | not detected, the same silent behaviour |
| KSP | open class with a final property | `'p' in 'Class1' is final and cannot be overridden` |
